- content_for :title do
  E-Learn | New course

-# styles.md §5: formulario en panel de ancho contenido, no a ancho completo.
.row.justify-content-center
  .col-lg-8
    %header.el-page-header
      .el-page-header__lead
        %span.el-page-header__eyebrow Teach
        %h1.el-page-header__title New course
      .el-page-header__actions
        = link_to 'Back to courses', courses_path, class: 'btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm'

    %section.el-panel
      .el-panel__body
        %p.el-meta.mb-4 Start with the title. You'll add lessons, price and cover in the next steps.
        = render 'form'
